        "# Interpreter shutdown\n",
        "\n",
        "Interpreter shutdown is the process of finalizing the interpreter when it exits. Cleanup order and the availability of globals can matter to code running during shutdown.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-interpreter-shutdown)"
      ]
    }
